 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "operations, experiences and deltas have equal length. Process them in order. For \"U\", add deltas[i] (possibly negative) to the total of experiences[i] (an experience starts at 0 and exists once it has been updated). For \"Q\", experiences[i] and deltas[i] are ignored and the answer is the name of the existing experience with the highest total, the lexicographically smallest name on ties, or \"\" when no experience exists yet. Return the answers of all queries in order.",
